    {
      "item": "triggerbot visibility trace",
      "reason": "Closed: 0x180017150 resolves EngineTraceClient003 into the engine-trace global, and 0x1800e2580 calls slot 4 (TraceRay) with mask 0x46004003 and a CDoubleTraceFilter skipping the local player. The runtime now resolves that interface and uses the trace; the angular gate remains only as a fallback when the interface is absent."
    },
    {
      "item": "backtrack rewind / bone history",
      "reason": "The recorder stores entity origins; per-bone history and server-time rewind require the missing lag-compensation path."
    },
    {
      "item": "anti-aim body desync modes 7-9",
